Package: pubflow
Title: Publish 'pipeflow' Pipelines: Parameter UIs, Result Viewers and Reports
Version: 0.0.0.9050
Authors@R: c(
    person("Roman", "Pahl", , "roman.pahl@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
    )
Description: Companion of 'pipeflow' that covers everything needed to
    publish the results of a pipeline: self-describing parameter objects
    with validity checks, a 'shiny' module that builds parameter inputs from
    a pipeline, step results as tables, figures and text, layout steps that
    arrange them into a document that is previewed in a 'shiny' viewer and
    rendered to HTML, 'Word' and PDF with 'pandoc', without a source file to
    knit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://rpahl.github.io/pubflow/, https://github.com/rpahl/pubflow
BugReports: https://github.com/rpahl/pubflow/issues
